          "speaker": "employeea",
          "displayTextIds": [
            "adv_employeea"
          ],
          "textId": "adv_script_anotherstory_10446_16",
          "text": "——原来如此。\n关于这次活动的风波，我要问的就这些了",
          "japanese": "――なるほど。\n今回のイベントの騒動について、聞き取りは以上です",
          "episodeUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10446/adv_script_anotherstory_10446-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10446-Episode.json.br",
