      "cues": [
        "adv_voice_anotherstory_10446_015"
      ],
      "text": "虽然你说上一个团体的争议风波\n全都是薇欧拉小姐在背后策划的……\n但目前没有任何证据能证明这一点",
      "evidenceType": "cue_and_text",
      "source": [
        {
          "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10446_015",
          "voiceId": 3103000013015,
          "speaker": "employeea",
          "displayTextIds": [
            "adv_employeea"
          ],
          "textId": "adv_script_anotherstory_10446_17",
          "text": "虽然你说上一个团体的争议风波\n全都是薇欧拉小姐在背后策划的……\n但目前没有任何证据能证明这一点",
          "japanese": "前グループでの炎上は全て\nビオラさんに仕組まれていたとのことですが……\n現状、それを裏付ける証拠は何もないと",
          "episodeUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10446/adv_script_anotherstory_10446-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10446-Episode.json.br",
